  "limitations": [
    "Search covers all APK ZIP member names and version/FileList path entries, two declared map-1 topology files, and class inventories of A-01 and StreamingAssets. It does not scan every serialized object in every bundle.",
    "Scene-cell xPos/zPos and smallSceneList describe cell-to-scene loading topology; they are not prefab instance positions. Saved prefab-local transforms are also not placement evidence.",
    "The strict plain SceneInfo reader follows recovered C# field/pop sequences and retains original bytes, byte spans, IDs, nonuniform scales, lightmap data and UV bytes. Encrypted layouts, IFix overrides and native consumer equivalence remain unverified.",
    "A successful selected-member layout decode does not authenticate its runtime role. No world placement or transformed matrix is published without source payload/consumer/frame corroboration.",
    "Selected original IL2CPP metadata literals retain their exact indices/byte spans. Their presence does not establish the loader's exact concatenation or a remote URI.",
    "External downloaded/cached scene information, legacy XAPK-derived placements and the installed APK evidence copy are outside this selected source search."
